### Section 15 — Debug common problems

| Problem                        | Possible cause                                         | Diagnosis and fix                                                                           |
| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Theme does not change          | CSS does not use the theme variables                   | Inspect <html> and verify data-theme changes between light and dark.                        |
| Theme resets after refresh     | Save logic is missing or uses a different key          | Verify localStorage.getItem("theme") and localStorage.setItem("theme", ...) both use theme. |
| JavaScript is not loading      | Wrong file path or browser cache                       | In DevTools → Network, find theme.js. Check for a 404 and correct the path.                 |
| CSS is not loading             | Incorrect stylesheet reference                         | Inspect Network for theme.css; check the file is inside wwwroot/css.                        |
| Local Storage is not saving    | Browser storage restrictions or a JavaScript exception | Check Console errors and test whether the storage is accessible.                            |
| Button click does nothing      | Wrong button ID or missing event listener              | Confirm the button ID is themeToggle and the script selects that exact ID.                  |
| Theme flashes before switching | Theme is initialized too late                          | Set the saved theme in an early head script before the CSS is applied.                      |
| Cards stay light in Dark Mode  | Bootstrap or custom styles override the theme          | Apply the app-card class and inspect computed CSS values.                                   |

